    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_entry",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I want to make a narrow intervention here rather than challenge the entire thesis."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌خوام اینجا یک ورود محدود به بحث داشته باشم، نه اینکه کل تز رو زیر سؤال ببرم."
        },
        "intent": "enter_seminar_discussion",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_intervention",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_thesis"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_premise",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The premise I would interrogate is that institutional stability necessarily implies social legitimacy."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "پیش‌فرضی که می‌خوام موشکافانه بررسی کنم اینه که ثبات نهادی لزوماً به معنای مشروعیت اجتماعی باشه."
        },
        "intent": "interrogate_premise",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_premise",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_interrogate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_framework",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Within that framework, the conclusion follows; outside it, some of the categories stop being analytically useful."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "داخل اون چارچوب، نتیجه منطقیه؛ بیرونش بعضی دسته‌بندی‌ها دیگه از نظر تحلیلی مفید نیستن."
        },
        "intent": "evaluate_framework",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_framework",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_thesis"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_situate",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would situate the argument historically before treating the author's categories as universally applicable."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "قبل از اینکه دسته‌بندی‌های نویسنده رو جهان‌شمول بدونم، استدلال رو در زمینه تاریخی خودش قرار می‌دم."
        },
        "intent": "situate_argument",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_situate",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_framework"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_qualify",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I agree with the direction of the claim, but I would qualify the mechanism more carefully."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "با جهت ادعا موافقم، ولی سازوکارش رو دقیق‌تر و محدودتر بیان می‌کنم."
        },
        "intent": "qualify_academic_claim",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_qualify",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_premise"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_implication",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "One implication of that reading is that the apparent contradiction may reflect competing definitions rather than incompatible evidence."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یکی از پیامدهای اون برداشت اینه که تناقض ظاهری شاید از تعریف‌های متفاوت بیاد نه از شواهد ناسازگار."
        },
        "intent": "draw_implication",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_implication",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_framework"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_build",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "To build on that point, the exception may actually reveal a boundary condition the theory needs to explain."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "برای ادامه اون نکته، استثنا شاید در واقع یک شرط مرزی رو نشون بده که نظریه باید توضیحش بده."
        },
        "intent": "build_on_peer_point",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_intervention",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_qualify"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_seminar_discourse_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Advanced seminar participation means locating exactly where you agree, where you intervene and what follows if your intervention is right."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشارکت پیشرفته در سمینار یعنی دقیق مشخص کنی کجا موافقی، کجا وارد بحث می‌شی و اگر نکته‌ت درست باشه چه پیامدی داره."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_seminar_control",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_seminar_discourse_intervention",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_implication",
          "c2_seminar_discourse_thesis"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_seminar_discourse_discourse_management",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-01",
        "slug": "c2-seminar-discourse-discourse-management",
        "title": "Managing complex discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Use signposting and metadiscourse to frame, sequence, return to, and close complex points without losing the listener.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با signposting و metadiscourse نکات پیچیده را قاب‌بندی، مرتب، دوباره جمع و نتیجه‌گیری می‌کنیم تا شنونده مسیر بحث را گم نکند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Before I come back to that point, let me clarify one assumption.",
            "fa": "قبل از اینکه به آن نکته برگردم، بگذار یک فرض را روشن کنم."
          },
          {
            "en": "That brings us to the broader question of accountability.",
            "fa": "این ما را به پرسش گسترده‌تر پاسخ‌گویی می‌رساند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_seminar_discourse_advanced_hedging",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-02",
        "slug": "c2-seminar-discourse-advanced-hedging",
        "title": "Advanced hedging and calibration",
        "rule_summary": "Calibrate certainty with expressions such as arguably, broadly speaking, tends to, appears to, and cannot entirely be ruled out.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در C1 میزان قطعیت را با عبارت‌هایی مثل arguably، broadly speaking، tends to، appears to و cannot entirely be ruled out دقیق تنظیم می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The change appears to have improved access, although the evidence is still limited.",
            "fa": "به نظر می‌رسد این تغییر دسترسی را بهتر کرده، هرچند شواهد هنوز محدود است."
          },
          {
            "en": "That explanation cannot entirely be ruled out.",
            "fa": "نمی‌توان آن توضیح را کاملاً منتفی دانست."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_seminar_discourse_stance_markers",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-03",
        "slug": "c2-seminar-discourse-stance-markers",
        "title": "Stance and viewpoint markers",
        "rule_summary": "Signal your relationship to a claim with frankly, admittedly, from my perspective, in practical terms, and crucially.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با عبارت‌هایی مثل frankly، admittedly، from my perspective، in practical terms و crucially موضع خود نسبت به یک ادعا را روشن می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Admittedly, the proposal is expensive, but the long-term case is stronger.",
            "fa": "درست است که پیشنهاد گران است، اما در بلندمدت استدلال قوی‌تری دارد."
          },
          {
            "en": "Crucially, the figures do not show who was affected most.",
            "fa": "نکته کلیدی این است که ارقام نشان نمی‌دهند چه کسانی بیشترین تأثیر را گرفته‌اند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_seminar_discourse_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-seminar-discourse-01",
        "title": "Seminar Discourse & Intellectual Positioning: part 1",
        "setting": "podcast planning call",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "characters": [
          "Nora",
          "Samir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "Where do you think the strongest part of the case is?",
            "translation_fa": "فکر می‌کنی قوی‌ترین بخش استدلال کجاست؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "I want to make a narrow intervention here rather than challenge the entire thesis.",
            "translation_fa": "می‌خوام اینجا یک ورود محدود به بحث داشته باشم، نه اینکه کل تز رو زیر سؤال ببرم."
          },
